menu "Station: web server"

    config WEB_PBKDF2_ITERATIONS
        int "Admin password hash cost (PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA256 iterations)"
        range 1000 1000000
        default 10000
        help
            Iterations for a newly set admin password. One check should take
            about 0.3 s on the device; the count is stored with each hash,
            so changing it needs no migration (existing passwords keep their
            count until they are changed). PROVISIONAL, to be measured on
            hardware.

endmenu
